<!--
  The standard Material "star_border" (hollow star) glyph. Hand-added rather than taken
  from an icon dependency because `material-icons-core`'s `Icons.Outlined.Star` is not
  actually outlined — its path data is identical to `Icons.Filled.Star` (a solid star), so
  using it made every star look filled regardless of the rating. The real hollow star only
  ships in `material-icons-extended`, which this project deliberately avoids — see ADR-010
  and CONVENTIONS.md § Resources.

  Hollow interior comes from the second subpath wound opposite to the first (nonzero fill).
-->
